WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.379
The calendar brings attendance, approved leave and pending corrections into one view.

00:00:04.429 --> 00:00:09.343
A senior approves the correction. The day changes to Present; the original record is retained.

00:00:09.393 --> 00:00:14.701
An eligible absence can be converted to leave after senior approval, with a reason and balance check.

00:00:14.751 --> 00:00:19.154
Apply for leave with dates, type and a reason. It remains pending until reviewed.

00:00:19.204 --> 00:00:23.796
Approved leave appears on the calendar. Pending requests do not silently become attendance.

00:00:23.846 --> 00:00:29.407
Attendance starts with the employee ID, typed or scanned from the ID card, before anything is recorded.

00:00:29.457 --> 00:00:35.148
Face ID then confirms it is the same employee. No camera is accessed in this mock and no photo is stored.

00:00:35.198 --> 00:00:40.112
Attendance is recorded with the time and the source. Login to the app stays separate from attendance.

